; rugen Dojo fight screen, generated by `rugen ui-gen --theme dojo`
; Drawn in 1280x720; see the rugen extension keys documented in crates/app/src/lifebar.rs.
; Wooden beams for life, a hanging plaque for the clock, seals for round wins
; and power levels. P1 vermilion, P2 brass.
